# Sustainable Production Methods Research Plan<br>
<br>
## Background<br>
<br>
The fashion industry is one of the largest polluters in the world. To reduce its environmental impact, it&#x27;s essential to adopt sustainable production methods.<br>
<br>
## Objectives<br>
<br>
* Identify effective sustainable production methods for the fashion industry.<br>
* Develop a plan for implementing these methods in my design project.<br>
<br>
## Methodology<br>
<br>
1. Conduct interviews with potential designers and manufacturers to gather insights on sustainable production methods.<br>
2. Research existing literature on sustainable fashion production.<br>
3. Analyze the benefits and challenges of each method.<br>
<br>
## Expected Outcomes<br>
<br>
* A comprehensive understanding of sustainable production methods for the fashion industry.<br>
* A plan for implementing these methods in my design project.<br>
<br>
## Timeline<br>
<br>
* Week 1-2: Conduct interviews with designers and manufacturers.<br>
* Week 3-4: Research existing literature on sustainable fashion production.<br>
* Week 5: Analyze benefits and challenges of each method.<br>
<br>
## Resources<br>
<br>
* Interviews with potential designers and manufacturers.<br>
* Existing literature on sustainable fashion production.<br>
